<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - QuickResponse rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - QuickResponse rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Albany Corp said analyst Ullas Naik initiated coverage of QuickResponse Services Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- cited strong position in the retail industry and strategy of deriving additional revenues from new value-added products.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $38.</p>
<p>-- estimated 1997 earnings of $1.00 a share.</p>
<p>-- estimated 1998 earnings of $1.31 a share.</p>
<p>-- QuickResponse provides product database and network services to retailers.</p>
<p>-- QuickResponse closed Friday at 29-1/8.</p>
</text>
